286 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The application is a comprehensive airport service platform designed to enhance the overall travel experience for passengers by addressing various challenges encountered during air travel. A key feature is the personal companion service, which is not only for unaccompanied minors but also for individuals with special needs and the elderly who may require additional support while traveling alone. This service ensures safety and provides dedicated assistance, giving families peace of mind. Users can also explore and reserve airport lounges in advance, gaining access to comfortable environments with various amenities. Furthermore, it addresses parking challenges by allowing users to reserve parking spaces before arrival, thus reducing stress and uncertainty. Lastly, the application offers a private driver service, facilitating convenient and reliable transportation options for travelers upon their arrival. By integrating these features, the app aims to streamline airport operations, improve communication, and ultimately create a more enjoyable and efficient travel experience for all passengers )
/E (The application is a comprehensive airport service platform designed to enhance the overall travel experience for passengers by addressing various challenges encountered during air travel. A key feature is the personal companion service, which is not only for unaccompanied minors but also for individuals with special needs and the elderly who may require additional support while traveling alone. This service ensures safety and provides dedicated assistance, giving families peace of mind. Users can also explore and reserve airport lounges in advance, gaining access to comfortable environments with various amenities. Furthermore, it addresses parking challenges by allowing users to reserve parking spaces before arrival, thus reducing stress and uncertainty. Lastly, the application offers a private driver service, facilitating convenient and reliable transportation options for travelers upon their arrival. By integrating these features, the app aims to streamline airport operations, improve communication, and ultimately create a more enjoyable and efficient travel experience for all passengers )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
