/P 979 0 R
/ActualText (The service shall assist elderly travelers, unaccompanied minors, and passengers with special needs to ensure their safety and support while navigating the airport. The application shall allow users to request this service by providing their details, such as name, email, phone number, and arrival date/time. Users will also be able to select the type of traveler \(e.g., child or adult\) through a toggle button. Once the request is submitted, airport staff will be notified to provide the necessary assistance.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [19]
